===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*krey-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|acerteynen}}, from {{der|en|fro|acertener}}, from {{m|fro|a-||to, towards}} + {{m|fro|certener||make sure of}}, from the adjective {{m|fro|certain}}, from {{der|en|la|certus||certain, fixed}}. Compare to {{cog|es|acertar}}.

